	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Prognosticum ex <placeName>Armenia</placeName> ad summum pontificem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>missum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Sol mense septembri in signo libre concordantibus una <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cunctis planetis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cum sit sol in <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>cauda draconis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>notat magna signa rerum terribilium, hoc <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>est aquarum diluvia, magnos ventos, qui obscurabunt <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>universum orbem ob terribilem motum ac terrorem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tonitruum et aquarum, quae exterminabuntur multa <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>aedificia et arbores.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quamplurimę vero valles <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>conglutinabuntur, et planities inde fiet, multę <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>urbes funditus desolabuntur, eo maxime in locis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>arenosis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ecclypis erit solis et lunę, quę <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>durabit a 3. usque ad meridiem eritque coloris <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ignei et rubri, qui significat mortalitatem magnam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>gentium.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">In oriente erunt et occidente multa bella, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>eritque universalis terrae motus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Maximę gentium <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>proditiones existent; morietur magnus monarcha.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Post diluvium autem non[n]ulli pauci superstites <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>erunt, et illi, qui supererunt, ditissimi erunt.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Deus nobis concedet suam sanctam manum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Millesimo quingentesimo sexagesimo nono<note type="margin">a.R.: 1569.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Haec ex Armenia <placeName ref="l425">Romam</placeName> missa <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>sunt, <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName> autem d. legato <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>nostro <persName ref="p931">Petro Grantrye</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Eadem haec mecum communicavit <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>d. d. <persName ref="p2776">Ruinella</persName>, qui a <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>d. accepit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
